sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant BE as FastAPI Backend
  participant GH as GitHub API
  participant EN as Analysis Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  User->>FE: Select repository
  FE->>BE: POST /analyze
  BE->>GH: Clone repository (shallow)
  GH-->>BE: Source files
  BE->>EN: Run complexity / duplication / maintainability
  EN-->>BE: Metrics + health score
  BE->>DB: Store analysis metadata
  BE-->>FE: AnalyzeResponse
  FE-->>User: Show dashboard & report
